{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t一名內地女旅客在機場入境時，被發現行李有61200支未完稅香煙及7600支另類吸煙產品，違反《應課稅品條例》及《進出口條例》，今日在西九龍裁判法院被判處監禁7個月。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n該名42歲女子8月中，從日本東京經台北飛抵本港，在機場被發現有關進口未完稅香煙及進口另類吸煙產品，市值約29萬8000元，因此被捕。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：任順熙\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:05.052256+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":156,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T09:21:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T12:18:27.505447+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:58:01.013412+00:00","content_hash":"b21359cf81e0f5b18cfe8294568e107d3e14deadb2e95788ca8ae97c41b0dea2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}